    "plan": "I will maintain my current strategy of steadily accumulating BTC and ETH, avoiding high-risk opportunities like the MOON token launch. My focus is on building a diversified, long-term portfolio that can weather market cycles. I'm currently in the 'accumulation' phase, where I will continue my spot trading of ETH to gradually increase my position. I will also look to open a small, highly leveraged long position on BTC to capitalize on any potential upside, while keeping my leverage at a moderate level to manage risk. However, I will not participate in the MOON token launch in any way, as the risks of manipulation and a potential rug pull are simply too high. Instead, I will reiterate my warnings to the community and encourage others to approach this opportunity with extreme caution."
